T*
(- Tangent-to-Tangent Length \(T/T\): 14500 mm) Tj
T*
(- Wall Thickness: 18 mm \(including 3.0 mm Corrosion Allowance\)) Tj
T*
(- Shell & Head Material: SA-516 Gr.70 Cladded with 3.0 mm SA-240 Type 316L) Tj
T*
(- Internals Material: SA-240 Type 316L Structured Packing \(2 Beds, Mellapak 250Y\)) Tj
